OL,3,AAustralian Greens senator denies claims
OL,4,Aof misconduct towards women
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn Australian Greens senator has denied
OL,7,Fallegations of inappropriate behaviour
OL,8,Ftowards women and accused his party of
OL,9,F"nasty political games", days after the
OL,10,Fclaims emerged.
OL,12,FLast Thursday, Greens leader David
OL,13,FShoebridge said Senator Jordon
OL,14,FSteele-John, 32, had taken leave from
OL,15,Fthe party room after a letter from
OL,16,Fseven current and former members said
OL,17,Fhe had been accused of "multiple
OL,18,Fallegations" of misconduct between 2017
OL,19,Fand 2025.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
