OL,3,AAustralian Greens senator denies claims
OL,4,Aof misconduct towards women
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn an online post on Sunday, the
OL,7,Fsenator denied the claims and said he
OL,8,Fwas not on leave. On a sexual assault
OL,9,Fclaim, he said police investigating the
OL,10,Fmatter had closed the case and no
OL,11,Fcharges were laid.
OL,13,FAn internal party probe has been
OL,14,Flaunched into the allegations.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
